{"id":"STm09_05_a","names":{"0":"","avg1_103":"Amber","avg1_108":"Kasimira","avg1_111":"Iris","avg1_112":"Noya","avg1_114":"Chaton","avg1_133":"Nazuka","avg1_134":"Fuyuka","avg1_139":"Allie","avg1_142":"Cosette","avg1_144":"Chitose","avg1_146":"Benito","avg1_156":"Nazuna","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_167":"Chica","avg3_168":"Chica","avg3_170":"Chico del Distrito de las Cenizas","avg3_207":"Myrsha","avg4_999":"Vita"},"en":{"0":"","avg1_103":"Amber","avg1_108":"Kasimira","avg1_111":"Iris","avg1_112":"Noya","avg1_114":"Chaton","avg1_133":"Nazuka","avg1_134":"Fuyuka","avg1_139":"Allie","avg1_142":"Cosette","avg1_144":"Chitose","avg1_146":"Benito","avg1_156":"Nazuna","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_167":"Generic Girl A","avg3_168":"Generic Girl B","avg3_170":"Generic Ash District Boy","avg3_207":"Myrsha","avg4_999":"Vita"},"tx":1,"steps":[["intro","Act Five","Noya's Intuition","A strange feeling rises in Noya’s heart: you are going to leave them today. You seal a pinky promise with her at the orphanage. After finalizing the retreat plan, you head to the negotiations to buy time..."],["trn",0,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","mirage_creche_inside_daylight",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_365"],["head","15:50, Nebula Month 18th, Mirage, Daisy Orphanage"],["stg",0,null,null,1.05,"OutBack",3.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_112","g","026",0.5,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_112","g",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_112","...==W== Ever since we left the White Cat's secret room... I've had this heavy premonition...",0,""],["w",1.0],["goon"],["w",1.0],["se","se_365_stop"],["se","se_483"],["ctl","avg1_112","g","014",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","That today ... is the day you leave us.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm","m107"],["mrt",2,"y","025","shock",null],["say","avg3_100","The day I leave them? What's going on?==W== Noya's intuition is always spot on. Does she ...==W== think I'm going to die?",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","009",null,null],["goon"],["w",1.0],["mrt",0,"y","020","question",null],["goon"],["mrt",0,"y","009","think","chijing"],["say","avg3_100","No, that's not right. I've faced plenty of danger before. Noya never panicked like this just because of a gut feeling.",2,""],["mrt",0,"y","012","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Maybe the injury is getting to her. Add that to the fact that things are worse than usual right now... Is fear clouding her judgment?",2,""],["mrt",0,"y","009","vexation",null],["say","avg3_100","Hmm...==W== As long as I have the White Room, death isn't permanent for me. It still hurts, though, and I can't exactly explain that to Noya. I'd better comfort her for now.",2,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","011",null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","white_room_inside_a",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","012",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bg","mirage_creche_inside_daylight",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","g","011",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","013","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","Don't worry, Noya. Whatever your intuition says, I'm not going anywhere.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","018",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Mm…",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","0","But Noya's expression only grows more serious.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_074"],["ctl","avg1_112","g","010",null,null,-0.35,1.5,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_112","==PLAYER_NAME==, I never doubt your conviction. But my intuition doesn't listen to reason.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","g","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Even when something looks completely foolproof, like it could never go wrong... Things still happen. A coincidence, or some tiny detail I missed. And then everything plays out exactly as I feared.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","g","017",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","That's why I...==W== Why I haven't been acting like myself today. I don't know what's going to go wrong. All I can do is ...==W== get busy, to give myself some peace of mind.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","023","vexation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","009","think",null],["say","avg3_100","She's genuinely terrified for me. Charging back at the Salvation Committee, hiding her wound to keep fighting... She did all of it for me. In that case...",2,""],["bgm",""],["mrt",0,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","We still have a little time. Tell me exactly what your intuition is telling you, Noya.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","014","music",null],["say","avg3_100","I might not be able to talk you out of it, since your intuition ignores logic. Just like when you thought crashing Loxy into a massive Stellaroid on the Waterway would actually work, and it did. But I can at least help put you at ease.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","006","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","R-Really?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","019","star",null],["say","avg3_100","Because your Boss can do anything.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","020",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Right! You're the wish-granting Boss. ==W==Heh heh, you still owe me a wish, you know.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","019","happy",null,null,null,null,"diantou2","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["bgm","m27"],["w",0.5],["se","se_071"],["ctl","avg1_112","g","003",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["say","avg1_112","Then, Boss, here is my wish.==W== Please relieve me of my anxiety!",0,""],["w",1.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","002","love",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Deal. Then tell me, what exactly does this premonition of me leaving feel like?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","023","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.35],["say","avg1_112","Mm... Usually, no matter where you are, whether I'm awake or asleep, whether I can see or hear you, my heart always senses you.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","tower_wishbox_room",0,1.0],["cbg",0,60.0,null,null,"Linear",3.0,null,null,null],["film",0],["ctl","avg1_112","g","006",null,0.3,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_112","It's hard to explain. Like back in Philae, when you and Chitose went into the Monolith. I could sense that you were safe the whole time.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Because of how strong Chitose is?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["film",1],["bg","mirage_creche_inside_daylight",0,1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","g","020","shy",0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Not exactly. It's just a feeling, really. I knew your trip would go smoothly. I didn't know whether you'd be able to wish for the right Artifact, but I was sure that you'd come back safe and keep traveling with us.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","g","023",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","But ... the second we stepped out of the White Cat's secret room, I lost that peace of mind.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_146"],["ctl","avg1_112","g","011",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Even with you walking right next to me, my stomach was in knots. I couldn't shake the feeling that if I looked away for even a second, you'd vanish into the tunnels.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Hmm... That's a tricky one to tackle.==W== Wait, when you were talking about Laru earlier, you said...",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002","attention",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_169"],["bgm",""],["trn",0,1,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","mirage_street_daylight",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_103","a","014",0.3,0.0,null,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_111","a","015",0.8,0.0,null,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_112","a","014",0.65,0.0,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_111","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_103","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","014","speechless",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_112","You know my gut is never wrong. And this time just feels ...==W== different. I've only ever felt like this once before.",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_112","g",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_169"],["bgm",""],["trn",0,1,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","mirage_creche_inside_daylight",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,2],["stg",0,null,null,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002","question",null],["say","avg3_100","When was that? Since I'm sitting right here with you safe and sound, your gut must have been wrong back then. That might be the key to all this.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_112","g","028",null,-0.35,1.5,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_112","g","028",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","The last time? Um...==W== It's a little hard to admit.",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","g",null,"shy",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","015","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Noya ... blushing? That's a rare sight.",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_112"],["ctl","avg1_112","g","023",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","But if I don't tell you, I'll just keep feeling anxious, and I hate that!==W== Fine. I'll tell you, but you can't laugh at me!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","022","exclamation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I won't laugh. I promise.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bg","sky_night_a",0,0.5],["film",0],["ctl","avg1_112","g","023","speechless",0.35,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",1.0],["w",1.0],["cbg",0,null,90.0,null,"Linear",3.0,null,null,null],["say","avg1_112","The last time I had this feeling ... was under the Monolith in Philae.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","When we fought the Big Three? That was pretty dangerous.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","008","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_112","No, not then. It was when you and Nazuka were whispering under the Monolith.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","025","symbol",null],["tsk","Zhong"],["say","avg3_100","Huh?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","story_main_04_001",0,0.0],["stg",0,60.0,null,null,"Linear",3.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","g","017",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Nazuka had just flown off with you. We followed Nazuna and hid in the woods to watch.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","g","026",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["bg","story_main_04_001_b",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_112","It was a beautiful night. And we heard ... everything Nazuka said to you.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","g","026",null,0.5,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,null,null,"Linear",0.1,null,null,null],["w",0.1],["bg","mirage_creche_inside_daylight",0,0.0],["film",1],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","g","026",null,0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_112","If you were able to make a promise like that, it means you both recognize each other as someone very important.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","g","027","speechless",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","She's beautiful, and she's incredibly strong. My intuition told me that staying at the Trekker Camp ... and living with the Petal Bloom might be a better fit for you.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_029"],["ctl","avg1_112","g","019",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Even though it'll be lonely traveling without you anymore... It doesn't matter as long as you two are happy.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Nazuka is very important to me.==W== But you, Iris, and Amber are just as important. Chitose is important, too. Everyone who has walked this path with me is irreplaceable.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","012","exclamation",null],["goon"],["mrt",0,"z","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Besides, Nazuka would never let me sit quietly in Philae.==W== We're Trekkers. We're meant to explore the world. Why would we ever stay in one place?",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","014","music",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","003","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Heh heh, yeah. That's why the feeling faded. I guess that was the one and only time my intuition got it wrong.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_030"],["ctl","avg1_112","g","017",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","But this time, there isn't another Trekker like Nazuka around...==W== My intuition couldn't possibly mean that evil Angie wants to capture you and lock you up forever, right?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","023",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","021","awkward",null],["say","avg3_100","Angie wouldn't capture me. She only wants me dead.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["fx",0,"fx_avg_flash_light",0,0],["ctl","avg1_112","g","006",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou2","OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Ah. I get it now, Boss. I know what's been making me so anxious.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm","m49"],["ctl","avg1_112","g","022","exclamation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","I know you well... If we really have no way out, you'll definitely use yourself as a bargaining chip to protect us!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","015","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","I...",1,""],["mrt",0,"y","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","I can't even argue. That's exactly what I'll do. I'd rather take the hit myself than watch them suffer. Besides... I still have the White Room.",2,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","story_main_01_037",0,0.0],["cbg",0,null,-90.0,null,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,null,0.0,null,"OutQuad",0.5,null,null,null],["mrt",0,"y","020","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Vita, would a Scepter of Death stop me from entering the White Room?",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_401"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_speaking",0,2],["say","avg4_999","Tyrant, your authority to enter the White Room is granted by the King piece. The Scepter of Death is merely a non-magical weapon. It cannot prevent this.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","012",null,null],["say","avg3_100","That settles it. Either the Book of Grace Prophecies is flawed, or Angie is misinterpreting it.",2,""],["mrt",0,"y","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I won't just throw my life away and violate the White Room's rules, but there's no reason to let my companions suffer. If it comes to death, I should bear it alone.",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.2],["w",0.2],["fx",0,"fx_avg_speaking",1,2],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutSine",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","mirage_creche_inside_daylight",5,0.0],["show","avg1_112","g","015",null,null,null,5,null,1.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.2],["w",0.2],["bgm",""],["stage",5,0,4],["ctl","avg1_112","g","015","symbol",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Boss, why aren't you saying anything? Don't tell me ... that's actually what you are planning?",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm","m3"],["mrt",1,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Well... It's not my first choice. But if it truly comes down to a choice like that, I suppose your intuition is correct.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stage",5,0,8],["fx",5,"fx_speedline_center",0,0],["ctl","avg1_112","g","012",null,null,-0.35,1.5,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_112","No! You cannot do that!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","013","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","I know you care. But... Losing one life is better than losing everyone's.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",5,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["se","se_070"],["ctl","avg1_112","g","009",null,null,null,null,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Not at all! Do you think we could just go on living like nothing happened if you died?==W== If we have to suffer like that, we'd rather die with you!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","010","resentful",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","014","exclamation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_112","I'm getting Iris and Amber right now! I'm going to make them wish... Wish that you never did something so incredibly stupid!",0,""],["bg","mirage_creche_inside_daylight",0,0.0],["w",0.5],["se","se_072"],["ctl","avg1_112","g",null,null,0.2,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["hide","avg1_112",0.5],["w",0.5],["stage",5,1,1],["se","se_074"],["stg",0,120.0,null,1.2,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["choice",["Grab Noya's hand"],[[]]],["w",0.5],["stg",0,20.0,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0,null,null,null],["se","se_019"],["show","avg1_112","g","027",0.4,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_112","g",null,null,0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",1.0],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Don't call them. Let's not make anyone else worry.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I promise you, I won't do anything stupid. I will never use myself as a bargaining chip for your safety. I will fight right beside you, and everyone else out there, until the very end.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","017",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","But ...==W== I don't have any wishes left.",0,""],["w",1.0],["se","se_055"],["ctl","avg1_112","g","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","023",null,null],["say","avg3_100","This is part of fulfilling your wish to ease your anxiety. If you need something more concrete, then let's...",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["choice",["Hold out my pinky finger"],[[]]],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","006","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","g","019","exclamation",null,-0.35,1.5,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_112","It's settled then. No taking it back. Here, pinky promise.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","All right. Pinky promise!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"niunie1"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_bubble",0,2],["ctl","avg1_112","g","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Forever and ever.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.25,"Linear",2.0,null,null,null],["film",0],["say","0","Noya and I link our pinkies, making a simple vow.",3,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["say","0","Noya stays like that, refusing to let go of our linked fingers for a long time.",3,""],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"z","015","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Noya?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["film",1],["bg","mood_3",5,0.0],["show","avg1_112","g","010",null,-0.45,1.9,5,null,1.0],["stage",5,0,0],["say","avg1_112","Boss, can you let me stay like this a little longer?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","g","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","I figure ... the longer we hold on, the stronger our promise will be.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",5,0.0,-150.0,null,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","g","028","sigh",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_112","Sigh. I feel so weird today. My head is full of things I would never even think about.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","We can hold on for as long as you want.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","013","love",null],["say","avg3_100","And the you I see today is still the best Noya there is.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","g","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["stage",5,1,1],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["say","0","We keep our pinkies linked in silence, sharing this rare moment of peace.",0,""],["hide","avg1_112"],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",1.5],["bgm",""],["se","se_063"],["bg","mirage_creche_inside_daylight",0,0.5],["show","avg1_111","a","017",null,0.1,0.9,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_111","a","017",null,null,-0.25,1.3,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_111","Boss, how is Noya's wound?",0,""],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_103","c","002",0.35,0.0,1.3,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_111","a","005",null,0.65,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["se","se_075"],["ctl","avg1_103","c","002",null,null,-0.25,null,1.0,null,"OutBack",0.6],["say","avg1_103","Time for the Eureka Bar...==W==",0,""],["w",1.0],["se","se_112"],["ctl","avg1_103","c","008",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["goon"],[